relaunchNotice:
Hello {{display_name}},

Development on OpenThrone has restarted, and we wanted you to hear it from us first.

All stats have been reset for Era 2, which is planned to run for the rest of 2026. We are sending this email to every inactive player and supporter on file. If you would like to come back, log in and start playing to see the new changes we have in store: {{loginLink}}

If we don't see you back, we are planning a major purge on {{deletionDate}} to protect the privacy of past members who have moved on. Your username and email will be anonymized in our system and your player ID will be locked. If you want to come back later, there is a privacy-focused way to claim your old account status: we keep only a one-way fingerprint of your email. Register again with the same address within two years and confirm the link we send there, and you will receive the Era 1 Tester title in recognition of your long-time support, get your original join date back, and may reclaim your old display name.

To learn more about the updates, read the latest news: {{newsLink}}

And don't worry: if you choose to do nothing, this is the last email you will get from us. You won't hear from us again unless you log back in, and once you are back you choose which emails you receive in your settings.

Would you rather close your account now? Erase it here, no sign-in needed: {{deleteLink}}

